      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry I still don\u0027t understand how that makes extra dependencies necessary. Can\u0027t it use the same deterministic topological order created here? If it\u0027s just a matter of retrieving more info later then it ought to work to store the module objects instead the jar paths, so that they can be queried for whatever is called for.\n\nBtw connecting up a dense graph like this is O(n^2), although I reckon it won\u0027t get seriously large.",
